{
  "tema": 5217,
  "slug": "vi-preterito-ver",
  "titulo": "Ver in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Ayer vi a Beto en la playa.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Ver in the preterite is vi, viste, vio, vimos, vieron: regular -er endings on the stem v-, but vi and vio are one syllable and take no written accent.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ver** uses the stem **v-** with the normal **-er** endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "ver"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**vi**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**viste**"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**vio**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "**vimos**"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ustedes",
              "**vieron**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Vi** and **vio** have **one syllable**, so **no written accent**: not ví, vió."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Don't keep the **e** of the infinitive: not **veí**, **veió**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When you see a **person**, add **a**: **vi a Beto**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **vi** is short like a blink. You saw it, and that was it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Ayer ==vi== a mi primo en la playa.",
              "en": "Yesterday I saw my cousin at the beach."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Viste== las olas de esta mañana?",
              "en": "Did you see this morning's waves?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Holden ==vio== una nave extraña cerca de Saturno.",
              "en": "Holden saw a strange ship near Saturn."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Vimos== el atardecer desde el malecón.",
              "en": "We watched the sunset from the boardwalk."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis vecinos ==vieron== un coyote en el cerro.",
              "en": "My neighbors saw a coyote on the hill."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==vieron== la pelea anoche?",
              "en": "Did you guys watch the fight last night?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==vi== la señal y me pasé la salida.",
              "en": "I didn't see the sign and missed the exit."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
